B.QM=new A.y("Morning Beach","The sun rises. Kiko invites you for a walk on the beach!","A good morning starts with a cheerful heart.",B.t)
B.Po=new A.y("Trash in the Sand","Plastic bottles are scattered everywhere. The beach is dirty.","Take your trash home \u2014 or use the beach bin.",B.F)
B.Nq=new A.y("Pretty Shells","Colorful shells wash ashore. Look, but leave them there.","Keep the memory with your eyes, and leave nature as it is.",B.M)
B.Rh=new A.y("Running Crab","A little crab runs to the sea. Give it room!","Make way for the smaller and weaker.",B.t)
B.Ni=new A.y("Turtle Eggs","A turtle lays eggs in the sand. They need a safe spot.","Turtle eggs are rare \u2014 protect them, do not take them.",B.t)
B.Pa=new A.y("Reef Fish","A clownfish hides in the anemone. So beautiful!","Every sea creature has its home \u2014 respect it.",B.U)
B.OH=new A.y("Bottles at Sea","Many bottles float by. Sea animals might swallow them by mistake.","Plastic in the sea is dangerous for fish and whales.",B.F)
B.Nf=new A.y("Pretty Coral","Colorful coral lies below. Thousands of fish live there.","Broken coral takes hundreds of years to grow back \u2014 protect it!",B.F)
B.OL=new A.y("Old Turtle","An old turtle comes by. It has traveled all the oceans!","The old have many stories \u2014 listen carefully.",B.U)
B.PG=new A.y("Baby Turtles","Tiny baby turtles hatch. They must reach the sea.","Do not block them \u2014 let them go home.",B.t)
B.Q9=new A.y("Fisherman Pak Eko","Pak Eko is an old fisherman. He tells of the sea long ago.","Respect elders and those who work hard for their family.",B.U)
B.QB=new A.y("Fish Market","At the fish market, everyone is honest about prices. Kiko learns.","Honest trade makes buyers trust you.",B.az)
B.Qv=new A.y("Dolphins","Dolphins leap in the sea! They are very smart.","Smart and still kind \u2014 that is true smart.",B.t)
B.Pc=new A.y("Net in the Sand","A fisherman's net lies on the sand, with a crab trapped in it.","Help the trapped \u2014 a small kindness that means a lot.",B.t)
B.Ot=new A.y("Rising Tide","The sea water rises. Kiko teaches when it is safe to play.","Obey warnings \u2014 from parents, teachers, and nature too.",B.U)
B.Qm=new A.y("Mangrove Forest","The mangroves protect the beach from waves. The trees are strong!",u.N,B.t)
B.N3=new A.y("Glass Bottle","A broken glass bottle is in the sand. It can hurt passing feet.","Pick up the dangerous \u2014 help others stay safe.",B.F)
B.NN=new A.y("Jellyfish","A jellyfish floats near the shore. Look, but do not touch.","The pretty can sometimes be dangerous \u2014 be careful.",B.M)
B.Rq=new A.y("Star Sand","The sand here holds shells like tiny stars.","Small things can be beautiful \u2014 look around you today.",B.t)
B.OD=new A.y("Lost Child","A little child looks for their mother on the beach. Let us help!","Help the lost \u2014 may you always be helped too.",B.t)
B.Om=new A.y("Whale Passes","A big whale passes in the distance. So amazing!","The big is not always scary \u2014 it is just passing by.",B.t)
B.Na=new A.y("Clean Beach","Kiko invites friends to pick up trash together. A cleaner beach!","Cleanliness is a shared job \u2014 invite your friends.",B.F)
B.R2=new A.y("Lighthouse","The lighthouse shines every night, guiding ships home safely.","Be like a lighthouse \u2014 give light to others.",B.t)
B.OO=new A.y("Heading Home","Evening comes. The fishermen return with fish for their families.","Today's hard work makes the family happy.",B.t)
B.Oh=new A.y("Turtles Return","The baby turtle from before is big now! It returns to the beach.","What you protect will come back to say thank you.",B.t)
B.P0=new A.y("Clean Beach Forever","The last day. The final boss and many friends are waiting.","Put trash in the bin \u2014 not just in the game, but every day!",B.F)
