B.Of=new A.y("Farmer Grandpa","Grandpa the farmer harvests rice. Help carry it to the barn.","Helping the old is a great kindness.",B.t)
B.OZ=new A.y("Rice Barn","Rice is stored for the hard season. Do not waste it.","Save and store for later \u2014 that is wise.",B.M)
B.Ry=new A.y("Grandma Tells Tales","Grandma tells village stories at night. Listen carefully.","Listen when elders speak \u2014 there is much wisdom there.",B.U)
B.Rj=new A.y("Morning Chores","The village chief feeds the cows before sunrise.","Wake early and work hard \u2014 the habit of great people.",B.t)
B.OT=new A.y("Night Watch","The people guard the village at night, taking turns at the post.","Keeping your turn keeps everyone safe.",B.M)
B.P5=new A.y("New Friend","A child sits alone. Kiko invites them to play together.","Invite the lonely \u2014 no one likes being left out.",B.t)
B.Pf=new A.y("Fair Chief","The village chief shares help fairly and openly with everyone.","A fair and honest leader is respected by all.",B.az)
B.Rw=new A.y("The Midwife","The midwife helps a sick neighbor. She is amazing!","Those who help many people \u2014 respect and thank them.",B.U)
B.R4=new A.y("After the Rain","Heavy rain makes the road slippery and muddy. The people pitch in.","In hard times, helping each other speeds the recovery.",B.t)
B.Qu=new A.y("Great Harvest","The whole village harvests together. The crop is shared fairly.","Work together, enjoy together \u2014 that is lovely.",B.M)
B.Og=new A.y("Village Hall","The village hall is cleaned for an event. Everyone helps sweep.","Public places are a shared duty \u2014 keep them clean.",B.F)
B.PP=new A.y("Harvest Feast","The village celebrates the harvest. All eat and laugh together.","Be thankful for the crop and share the joy with neighbors.",B.t)
B.ON=new A.y("Farewell Greeting","Kiko says goodbye. Kiss the grandparents' hands before leaving.","Say a polite goodbye \u2014 a sign of love and respect.",B.U)
