B.OX=new A.y("Zero Gravity","Things float in space. Tidy them up so nothing gets lost.","Be neat and orderly \u2014 wherever you are.",B.M)
B.NH=new A.y("Earth from Above","From the window, Earth looks small, blue, and beautiful.","Earth is our only home \u2014 take good care of it.",B.t)
B.NU=new A.y("Moon Footprint","A footprint on the moon can last thousands of years. Step carefully.","Every step leaves a mark \u2014 choose the good ones.",B.M)
B.Nm=new A.y("Save Oxygen","In space, air and water are limited. Use just enough.","Save the limited \u2014 in space and on Earth.",B.M)
B.Pb=new A.y("Star Guide","Long ago, sailors used the stars to find their way.","Learn from those before us \u2014 knowledge is a legacy.",B.U)
