B.Pq=new A.y("Red Planet","Mars is dusty and cold. The scientists want to understand it.","Curiosity takes people far \u2014 keep it alive.",B.M)
B.R3=new A.y("Asteroid Belt","Many space rocks fly by. The team reminds each other to stay safe.","Remind each other for good \u2014 that shows you care.",B.t)
B.QN=new A.y("Signal to Earth","Kiko sends good news to his family back on Earth.","Tell your loved ones \u2014 they are always waiting.",B.t)
B.NK=new A.y("Distant Star","The star we see is really light from long ago.","What you do today can have an effect for a long time.",B.M)
B.PE=new A.y("Warm Sun","The sun gives light and energy to the whole Earth.","Bring good to many people, like the sun.",B.t)
B.RP=new A.y("Ringed Planet","Saturn has lovely rings of ice and rock. Amazing!","Learning makes us admire nature even more.",B.U)
B.ND=new A.y("Giant Telescope","A giant telescope can see far galaxies. The work of scientists.","Value the hard work of those who advance knowledge.",B.U)
B.Rd=new A.y("Meteor Shower","Meteors streak by like falling stars. Kiko makes a good wish.","Make good dreams real with effort, not just hope.",B.M)
B.N2=new A.y("Weather Satellite","A satellite watches the weather, helping farmers and fishermen on Earth.","Knowledge used to help \u2014 that is great knowledge.",B.t)
B.NE=new A.y("Vast Galaxy","The galaxy is so vast. We are small, but we still matter.","However small you are, your kindness matters.",B.M)
B.Pd=new A.y("Rocket Trouble","One part of the rocket breaks. The team fixes it calmly.","Face problems calmly and work together.",B.M)
