B.NZ=new A.y("Getting Ready to Go Home","The mission is almost done. Kiko misses his family on Earth.","However great the adventure, home is still special.",B.t)
B.OE=new A.y("Safe Landing","The rocket lands smoothly thanks to the whole team working together.","Big success is always the result of working together.",B.M)
B.Qo=new A.y("Stories to Friends","Kiko shares his space knowledge and stories with his friends.","Share good knowledge \u2014 kindness becomes contagious.",B.t)
